{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/115629","id":3227610660,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7AYW4k","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115629","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115629.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115629.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115629","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/115629/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/115629/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115629/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/dd7594f74ad79b4e366a279f24af4b3732f77074","number":115629,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Fix non-static variable autocompletion in class body","user":{"login":"Scrawach","id":40476180,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNDc2MTgw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/40476180?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scrawach","html_url":"https://github.com/Scrawach","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scrawach/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scrawach/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scrawach/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scrawach/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scrawach/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scrawach/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scrawach/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scrawach/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scrawach/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"- Fixes: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103221\r\n\r\n## Example\r\n\r\n| Before | After |\r\n|---|---|\r\n| <img width=\"380\" height=\"217\" alt=\"before_fix\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3e4947cf-6374-42a0-a922-ffc14b75dd55\" /> | <img width=\"380\" height=\"217\" alt=\"after_fix\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/bc4a24f9-6aca-44ce-a593-d7eeeb10f946\" /> |\r\n\r\n## Details\r\n\r\nBug was in incomplete definition of static. Before expression was as follows:\r\n\r\n```cpp\r\nbool is_static = !p_context.current_function || p_context.current_function->is_static;\r\n```\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/80a4af1cc7c97b41f819ac2ac519a12804a53b1c/modules/gdscript/gdscript_editor.cpp#L1532-L1534\r\n\r\nWhen work with variable (not a function), we immediately get true in expression. Therefore, autocomplete didn't work for non-static variables outside of functions in class body.\r\n\r\n## Fix\r\n\r\nI additionally add a current variable in context during parsing and expression:\r\n\r\n```cpp\r\nbool is_static = (current_function && current_function->is_static) || (current_variable && current_variable->is_static);\r\n```","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098082,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwODI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gdscript","name":"topic:gdscript","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/